        super.onCreateOptionsMenu(menu, inflater);
        inflater.inflate(R.menu.my_menu, menu);
    }
}
```

In this example, we're inflating a toolbar layout file (`toolbar_layout.xml`) and setting it as the action bar in our fragment's activity. We're also customizing the toolbar's behavior by displaying a back button when the user taps on the toolbar.

